WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Others weren't paying.

00:01.000 --> 00:04.500
China didn't have to pay until 2030.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.340
Russia was given an old standard that was easy to meet,

00:08.340 --> 00:11.460
a 1990 standard.

00:11.460 --> 00:13.440
But for the United States, we're supposed to pay

00:13.440 --> 00:14.640
like a trillion dollars.

